[4.2, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m  cka-practice\u001b[0m \u001b[2mv2.0.0\u001b[0m \u2014 11 exams, 100 points each, pass mark 66\r\n  \u001b[2mgrouped by CKA domain, heaviest first\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m30%  Troubleshooting\u001b[0m\r\n     5  nodes         Worker node failures: kubelet, taints, static pods   \u001b[2mnot seeded\u001b[0m\r\n     6  tshoot        General troubleshooting: control plane, pods, RBAC   \u001b[2mnot seeded\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m25%  Cluster architecture, installation and configuration\u001b[0m\r\n     1  helm-core     Helm: install, rollback, values, packaging           \u001b[2mnot seeded\u001b[0m\r\n     2  helm-values   Helm: repos, values files, --atomic, subcharts       \u001b[2mnot seeded\u001b[0m\r\n     3  helm-oci      Helm: real charts, CRDs, OCI registries              \u001b[2mnot seeded\u001b[0m\r\n     8  cluster       etcd backup and restore, kubeadm, certificates       \u001b[2mnot seeded\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[32m\u25b8 \u001b[0m11  kustomize     Kustomize: overlays, patches, generators, apply -k   \u001b[2m\u00b7\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m20%  Services and networking\u001b[0m\r\n     4  netpol        NetworkPolicy and network troubleshooting            \u001b[2mnot seeded\u001b[0m\r\n    10  gateway       Ingress, Gateway API, and CNI troubleshooting        \u001b[2mnot seeded\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m15%  Workloads and scheduling\u001b[0m\r\n     9  workloads     Workloads and scheduling: rollouts, Jobs, affinity   \u001b[2mnot seeded\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m10%  Storage\u001b[0m\r\n     7  storage       Storage: PV, PVC, StorageClass, StatefulSet volumes  \u001b[2mnot seeded\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mselected:\u001b[0m \u001b[1mkustomize\u001b[0m  \u001b[2m(Kustomize: overlays, patches, generators, apply -k)\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mcka scores\u001b[0m grades every exam \u2014 takes a couple of minutes.\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mcka use <name>\u001b[0m   switch     \u001b[1mq N \u00b7 grade \u00b7 explain N \u00b7 next\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
