[9.445, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[2mselected\u001b[0m \u001b[1mkustomize\u001b[0m \u2014 Kustomize: overlays, patches, generators, apply -k\r\n  \u001b[2mq N \u00b7 grade \u00b7 explain N \u00b7 next\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m  Exam 11 for the CKA\u001b[0m \u2014 13 tasks \u00b7 100 points \u00b7 pass mark 66\r\n  \u001b[2mKustomize \u00b7 namespace: kust-lab \u00b7 tree: /root/exam11\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  [\u001b[32m\u2714\u001b[0m]  1  7   pts  '/root/exam11/base' holds two plain manifests \u2014 deployment\r\n  [\u001b[32m\u2714\u001b[0m]  2  8   pts  Every object this base renders must land in namespace 'kus\r\n  [\u001b[32m\u2714\u001b[0m]  3  8   pts  Every object rendered from the base \u2014 the Deployment, the \r\n  [\u001b[32m\u2714\u001b[0m]  4  8   pts  The rendered Deployment must run image 'nginx:1.27-alpine'\r\n  [\u001b[32m\u2714\u001b[0m]  5  7   pts  The Deployment must run 4 replicas.\r\n  [\u001b[32m\u2714\u001b[0m]  6  9   pts  The application needs configuration from a ConfigMap.\r\n  [\u001b[32m\u2714\u001b[0m]  7  7   pts  A second ConfigMap must be generated for a component that \r\n  [\u001b[32m\u2714\u001b[0m]  8  7   pts  The application also needs a Secret.\r\n  [\u001b[32m\u2714\u001b[0m]  9  9   pts  Create a production overlay at '/root/exam11/overlays/prod\r\n  [\u001b[32m\u2714\u001b[0m] 10  8   pts  The production Service must carry the annotation\r\n  [\u001b[32m\u2714\u001b[0m] 11  7   pts  Write everything the prod overlay renders to '/root/answer\r\n  [\u001b[32m\u2714\u001b[0m] 12  8   pts  '/root/exam11/broken' contains a kustomization that does n\r\n  [\u001b[32m\u2714\u001b[0m] 13  7   pts  Count how many Kubernetes objects the prod overlay renders\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mq N   \u00b7   grade   \u00b7   explain N   \u00b7   kustinfo   \u00b7   examhelp\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
