[17.295, "o", "\r\n\u001b[36m\u250c\u2500 Exam 11 \u00b7 Task 4/13 \u2500 8 points\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[36m\u2514\u001b[0m\r\nThe rendered Deployment must run image 'nginx:1.27-alpine'.\r\nChange it from the kustomization and re-apply. base/deployment.yaml must\r\nstill name the image it names now.\r\n\r\n\u001b[2m  when you are done:  grade 4      stuck?  explain 4\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
